@startmindmap
* Next runtime boundary (T-485)
** web manifest+lock
*** gebaut: apps/web/package.json::dependencies.next (16.3.4)
*** gebaut: apps/web/package-lock.json::node_modules/next + @next/swc-*
** dashboard manifest+lock
*** gebaut: apps/dashboard/package.json::dependencies.next (16.3.4)
*** gebaut: apps/dashboard/package-lock.json::node_modules/next + @next/swc-*
** CI client gate
*** gebaut: .github/workflows/ci.yml::test-clients
*** gebaut: image-codec.check.mjs
** Docker runtimes
*** gebaut: apps/web/Dockerfile.prod::CMD node server.js
*** gebaut: apps/dashboard/Dockerfile.prod::CMD node server.js
** Request edge
*** gebaut: web matched paths -> proxy.ts
**** bypass: /api, _next, _vercel, dotted paths
*** gebaut: dashboard matched protected paths -> auth + canAccess
**** bypass checks: /api/auth early return
** Dashboard route handlers
*** gebaut: api/auth/[...nextauth]/route.ts::GET,POST
*** gebaut: api/discourse/route.ts::GET
*** gebaut: api/proxy/[...path]/route.ts
** OG image generation
*** offen: no next/og ImageResponse importer
@endmindmap

@startuml
component "web manifest+lock" as WL
component "dashboard manifest+lock" as DL
component "CI client gate" as CI
component "web Docker runtime" as WD
component "dashboard Docker runtime" as DD
component "web request edge" as WP
component "dashboard request edge" as DP
component "web pages" as WPG
component "dashboard pages + route handlers" as DRH

WL --> CI : npm ci / npm run build
DL --> CI : npm ci / npm run build
WL --> WD : npm ci / npm run build
DL --> DD : npm ci --ignore-scripts / npm run build
WD --> WP : matcher-selected requests only
DD --> DP : matcher-selected requests
WP --> WPG : redirects / rewrites / intlMiddleware
DP --> DRH : protected pages + non-auth APIs\nauth + canAccess
note bottom of WP
  matcher bypasses /api, _next, _vercel
  and dotted paths
end note
note bottom of DP
  /api/auth/* returns before protected
  user and canAccess checks
end note
note bottom of DRH
  next/og ImageResponse: offen (0 importers)
end note
@enduml

